\p{The next principle to consider, I like to call the \em{subtraction rule}, though as we will see, a more general version of this principle usually goes by another name.}

\transclude{00G9}   % Subtraction rule
\transclude{00GA}   % Lunches
\transclude{00GB}   % Bit strings
\transclude{00GC}   % PIE
